WEBVTT

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:10.990
Please don't expect too much from it.
This story is a simple illustration of the three
Minami sisters and the ordinary life they lead.

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:22.220
Hi, Riko.

00:00:22.220 --> 00:00:23.640
Can I come over?

00:00:23.640 --> 00:00:25.200
What? You're busy?

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:26.640
You're going out?

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.350
Aw, man. My schedule's ruined...

00:00:29.350 --> 00:00:30.750
Oh, you're in a hurry?

00:00:30.750 --> 00:00:32.160
Okay.

00:00:34.270 --> 00:00:35.550
My schedule...

00:00:35.930 --> 00:00:37.970
That's not a schedule.

00:00:37.970 --> 00:00:42.480
What? You have a problem with my perfect schedule board?

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:45.420
All you're scheduled to do is have fun.

00:00:45.420 --> 00:00:47.760
Don't you have any plans to study?

00:00:57.970 --> 00:00:59.820
What'd you do that for?

00:00:59.820 --> 00:01:01.700
You've totally messed up my schedule!

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:10.290
There.

00:01:23.600 --> 00:01:25.440
What are you two up to?

00:01:27.180 --> 00:01:27.870
<b>Today's Plans</b>

00:01:27.870 --> 00:01:32.480
Uh... I've been thinking of
.changing up my schedule.
<b>Today's Plans</b>

00:01:32.480 --> 00:01:34.210
Like adding study time.
<b>Today's Plans</b>

00:01:34.210 --> 00:01:35.420
<b>Today's Plans</b>

00:01:35.420 --> 00:01:37.350
Yeah, something like that.
<b>Today's Plans</b>

00:01:37.350 --> 00:01:39.050
Like adding study time.
<b>Today's Plans</b>

00:01:39.050 --> 00:01:39.950
<b>Today's Plans</b>

00:01:39.950 --> 00:01:41.820
You're such a good girl, Kana,

00:01:41.820 --> 00:01:44.470
planning to study like that.

00:01:44.470 --> 00:01:45.830
Here you go.

00:01:46.830 --> 00:01:50.340
N-No thanks. If I write it in marker, I won't be able to erase—

00:03:28.980 --> 00:03:32.980
A Girl Cannot Hide Her Suntan, Nor Her Heart

00:03:32.980 --> 00:03:35.480
This horoscope is really accurate!

00:03:35.480 --> 00:03:37.730
You sure like horoscopes, Riko.

00:03:37.730 --> 00:03:40.600
Hold on, you're a Libra, right?

00:03:40.600 --> 00:03:43.320
It says you'll have really bad luck today, and to beware of water.

00:03:43.320 --> 00:03:45.260
That's right.

00:03:45.260 --> 00:03:47.820
Maybe being accurate
.isn't such a good thing.

00:03:47.820 --> 00:03:49.820
It's a little worrying.

00:03:49.820 --> 00:03:53.710
It says to beware of water,
and yet we're going to the pool.

00:03:53.710 --> 00:03:57.880
C-Could she... D-Drown in the...

00:03:57.880 --> 00:03:59.510
Cut it out!

00:04:00.380 --> 00:04:03.260
Who cares about your
stupid horoscope, moron?

00:04:03.260 --> 00:04:05.570
As you can see, we have
a Libra of our own.

00:04:05.570 --> 00:04:07.390
It's all just ridiculous nonsense!

00:04:09.850 --> 00:04:11.390
And she's back to sleep.

00:04:12.090 --> 00:04:16.810
I hope this blue dress will improve my
.luck a bit. It's my lucky color, after all.

00:04:17.370 --> 00:04:19.810
Your lucky item's a stuffed animal, huh?

00:04:27.160 --> 00:04:28.400
Look at that!

00:04:28.400 --> 00:04:34.040
It didn't reach Chiaki because that stuffed animal protected our Libra from water!

00:04:34.040 --> 00:04:36.540
Amazing! It really <i>is</i> lucky!

00:04:36.540 --> 00:04:41.290
It's almost like a great tree
drawing water from the earth!

00:04:41.290 --> 00:04:44.550
Kana... Why don't you hurry and bring something to clean it up?

00:04:45.160 --> 00:04:47.850
This horoscope... is the real thing!

00:04:49.800 --> 00:04:52.270
Sorry I'm late!

00:04:52.270 --> 00:04:54.240
just hit the
Let's get going!

00:04:54.240 --> 00:04:55.340
Yeah!
just hit the

00:04:55.340 --> 00:04:55.940
just hit the

00:04:58.850 --> 00:05:00.150
Absolutely not!

00:05:00.150 --> 00:05:01.420
<i>Why</i> not?

00:05:01.420 --> 00:05:03.190
You can't go in the pool.

00:05:03.580 --> 00:05:04.930
Beware of water!

00:05:04.930 --> 00:05:08.150
Th-That's what the
..horoscope said, but...

00:05:08.150 --> 00:05:11.200
If only someone here
..was wearing blue...

00:05:11.560 --> 00:05:12.450
But you're red.

00:05:12.850 --> 00:05:13.580
And I'm white.

00:05:14.020 --> 00:05:14.710
Orange.

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:15.830
Pink.

00:05:16.220 --> 00:05:19.130
In short, you're not allowed
anywhere <i>near</i> the water!

00:05:19.600 --> 00:05:23.220
Why'd I even come to the pool, then?

00:05:23.220 --> 00:05:24.170
Oh?

00:05:24.170 --> 00:05:25.340
Hey!

00:05:25.800 --> 00:05:27.770
Oh, Fujioka?

00:05:27.770 --> 00:05:30.350
You all came to the pool
.too? What a coincidence.

00:05:31.910 --> 00:05:33.140
Fujioka... you...

00:05:36.900 --> 00:05:38.780
Wh-What?

00:05:40.800 --> 00:05:42.400
Hey, Keiko.

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:43.570
What is it?

00:05:43.570 --> 00:05:44.750
What do you see?

00:05:47.330 --> 00:05:50.010
It's blurry, but it looks blue-ish.

00:05:50.010 --> 00:05:50.940
That's right.

00:05:50.940 --> 00:05:52.240
The lucky color.

00:05:53.110 --> 00:05:54.150
Riko.

00:05:54.150 --> 00:05:56.330
You can get in the pool as
.long as you're with Fujioka.

00:05:56.330 --> 00:05:57.460
What?

00:05:58.090 --> 00:05:59.420
Fujioka.

00:05:59.420 --> 00:06:03.030
We have reason to believe
.Riko may drown today.

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:08.010
However, you may be
.able to change her fate.

00:06:09.250 --> 00:06:12.470
Fujioka! Take Riko's hand!

00:06:12.470 --> 00:06:13.640
Please!

00:06:18.120 --> 00:06:19.820
I-I got it.

00:06:19.820 --> 00:06:20.890
You can count on me.

00:06:24.980 --> 00:06:26.740
Now, take my hand.

00:06:26.740 --> 00:06:29.490
Wh-What?

00:06:29.490 --> 00:06:31.810
Come on. You can trust me.

00:06:32.510 --> 00:06:34.490
Really bad luck today?

00:06:34.490 --> 00:06:37.000
That horoscope couldn't be
further from the truth!

00:06:37.360 --> 00:06:38.610
Come on!

00:06:39.250 --> 00:06:41.340
Y-Yes!

00:06:46.920 --> 00:06:47.880
Huh? What?!

00:06:48.680 --> 00:06:49.630
Riko?!

00:06:50.580 --> 00:06:52.460
This is pure bliss!

00:07:00.510 --> 00:07:04.030
I hear Maki and Atsuko are
.working part-time together.

00:07:05.150 --> 00:07:08.510
You need to go to interviews to get part-time jobs, right?

00:07:08.510 --> 00:07:09.860
Interviews, huh?

00:07:09.860 --> 00:07:11.800
I wonder what you have to do.

00:07:12.490 --> 00:07:17.710
Aren't you supposed to show them what you can do, like your hobbies and talents and stuff?

00:07:17.710 --> 00:07:19.640
They call it "self-promotion," right?

00:07:19.640 --> 00:07:21.420
Self-promotion?

00:07:21.420 --> 00:07:23.250
I'm pretty bad at that.

00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:25.500
Don't be so negative.

00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:26.880
Let's practice!

00:07:27.270 --> 00:07:29.880
I'll be the interviewer
.and ask you questions.

00:07:29.880 --> 00:07:30.460
Okay.

00:07:30.460 --> 00:07:31.660
I'll give it a shot.

00:07:31.660 --> 00:07:33.140
Wait, Kana.

00:07:33.140 --> 00:07:39.430
I shall interview you to see if you're fit for the role of interviewer.

00:07:39.430 --> 00:07:43.440
Does that mean Chiaki's a
natural-born interviewer?

00:07:45.470 --> 00:07:46.840
Well then, Kana-san.

00:07:46.840 --> 00:07:47.900
Y-Yes?

00:07:47.900 --> 00:07:49.940
Tell me about yourself.

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:53.020
U-Um... I'm...

00:07:54.660 --> 00:07:55.700
a real cutie.

00:07:55.700 --> 00:07:57.700
What kind of self-promotion is that?!

00:07:57.700 --> 00:08:00.960
Hmm... That wasn't very clear.

00:08:00.960 --> 00:08:03.730
Oh? It wasn't?

00:08:03.730 --> 00:08:08.960
Could you provide more details to make it clear <i>how</i> you're a cutie?

00:08:09.520 --> 00:08:11.590
P-Please excuse me for a minute.

00:08:25.190 --> 00:08:26.610
Thank you for waiting.

00:08:26.610 --> 00:08:29.110
Wow, that really <i>does</i> make it clear!

00:08:29.110 --> 00:08:31.530
Well demonstrated. You pass.

00:08:31.530 --> 00:08:32.930
Yay!

00:08:32.930 --> 00:08:34.650
She passed?!

00:08:37.870 --> 00:08:41.620
Please allow me to be the interviewer from this point forward.

00:08:41.980 --> 00:08:45.950
Um... You're gonna keep that cutie act going even while you interview us?

00:08:45.950 --> 00:08:48.060
I'm a bit uncomfortable with
..the way you're talking...

00:08:48.060 --> 00:08:50.630
I'm sorry, but I can't answer
.your questions at present.

00:08:51.330 --> 00:08:53.380
Please tell me about yourself.

00:08:53.380 --> 00:08:55.410
U-Uh...

00:08:57.580 --> 00:09:00.010
People always say I have
.a bright personality.

00:09:00.400 --> 00:09:02.420
I couldn't agree more!

00:09:02.420 --> 00:09:06.150
You're brighter than the fluorescent lamp we replaced yesterday!

00:09:06.150 --> 00:09:08.110
This is terrible!

00:09:11.570 --> 00:09:16.080
Chiaki-san, help! This bag of crackers is sealed too tightly for me to open!

00:09:16.080 --> 00:09:18.250
Just cut the top off with scissors.

00:09:18.820 --> 00:09:21.870
I hate people trying to be cute even more than interviews.

00:09:30.710 --> 00:09:35.020
What motivated you to visit our home today, Fujioka-san?

00:09:35.020 --> 00:09:37.050
Uh... my motivation?

00:09:38.690 --> 00:09:41.350
You called and asked me to come over.

00:09:41.780 --> 00:09:46.710
I asked you to come over to my home? How naughty of me.

00:09:46.710 --> 00:09:47.600
Why would you say that?!

00:09:50.450 --> 00:09:52.600
Chiaki-chan, what's going on?

00:09:52.600 --> 00:09:54.650
Something's not right about her.

00:09:54.650 --> 00:09:59.870
We can't answer your questions at present, but I'll give you a hint.

00:09:59.870 --> 00:10:01.800
To promote yourself,

00:10:01.800 --> 00:10:07.940
you must demonstrate what kind of person you are. Show us how you think.

00:10:10.380 --> 00:10:14.260
Please tell us about yourself, Fujioka-san.

00:10:18.420 --> 00:10:19.410
This...

00:10:20.400 --> 00:10:22.510
This is all I can come up with right now.

00:10:26.850 --> 00:10:28.020
I...

00:10:29.100 --> 00:10:31.270
I love the usual Minami Kana!

00:10:38.740 --> 00:10:40.750
Man, I'm glad to hear it!

00:10:40.750 --> 00:10:44.260
I didn't feel like stopping
.until someone said that.

00:10:44.260 --> 00:10:44.940
Huh?

00:11:01.910 --> 00:11:05.150
All right! Let's swim straight
across the Pacific Ocean!

00:11:05.150 --> 00:11:06.350
Yeah!

00:11:06.350 --> 00:11:09.890
Don't forget to stretch before entering the sea, everyone!

00:11:10.300 --> 00:11:10.330
All right! One, two...

00:11:10.330 --> 00:11:11.480
Okay!
All right! One, two...

00:11:11.480 --> 00:11:12.610
Hey, Kana...
All right! One, two...

00:11:12.610 --> 00:11:13.550
What is it?
All right! One, two...

00:11:13.550 --> 00:11:13.650
What is it?

00:11:13.650 --> 00:11:16.240
You should've told me that
we were going to the beach!

00:11:16.240 --> 00:11:18.250
I need to prepare myself for these things.

00:11:20.030 --> 00:11:21.950
You're wearing a swimsuit, right?

00:11:21.950 --> 00:11:23.280
You seem prepared enough to me.

00:11:24.380 --> 00:11:26.630
That's because you told me to wear it!

00:11:27.270 --> 00:11:30.170
And besides, Yoshino is here today.

00:11:30.170 --> 00:11:33.020
Wearing a swimsuit is just too much!

00:11:33.020 --> 00:11:33.750
How come?

00:11:33.750 --> 00:11:37.240
Yoshino may have already
.found out who I really am.

00:11:37.240 --> 00:11:39.170
Aren't you going to change into your swimsuit, Mako-chan?

00:11:40.110 --> 00:11:44.760
Uh... I'm not feeling too well today.

00:11:44.760 --> 00:11:45.930
Really?

00:11:45.930 --> 00:11:49.710
And I was hoping you could
..show me how to swim, too...

00:11:49.710 --> 00:11:52.730
Oh, I'll be okay after a bit of rest.

00:11:52.730 --> 00:11:53.730
Go on ahead.

00:11:53.730 --> 00:11:54.970
I see.

00:11:54.970 --> 00:11:56.320
I'll be waiting.

00:12:04.730 --> 00:12:06.780
By the way, take a look over there.

00:12:09.670 --> 00:12:13.060
Maki-chan and Atsuko
.will be joining us later.

00:12:13.060 --> 00:12:13.880
See ya!

00:12:21.840 --> 00:12:23.080
Mako-chan.

00:12:23.080 --> 00:12:25.090
Chiaki and the others already left.

00:12:25.090 --> 00:12:26.220
R-Right...

00:12:27.970 --> 00:12:29.410
Take that!

00:12:37.980 --> 00:12:39.140
Mako-chan.

00:12:39.730 --> 00:12:41.110
Want some suntan oil?

00:12:42.800 --> 00:12:45.320
I can rub it on you, if you'd like.

00:12:58.420 --> 00:13:00.420
Look, it's Mako-chan.

00:13:04.300 --> 00:13:06.220
Huh? Is she all right?

00:13:10.330 --> 00:13:11.630
Haruka-shan...

00:13:12.680 --> 00:13:14.160
Mako-chan!

00:13:17.520 --> 00:13:19.980
Her face is bright red.

00:13:20.710 --> 00:13:24.070
What did Haruka-chan do to her?

00:13:28.250 --> 00:13:31.540
Don't let go, you hear me?

00:13:31.870 --> 00:13:32.930
Of course.

00:13:32.930 --> 00:13:34.660
You can trust me, Chiaki.

00:13:35.460 --> 00:13:36.330
Okay.

00:13:36.820 --> 00:13:38.060
Yeah, just like that.

00:13:38.060 --> 00:13:40.920
Relax the rest of your body.
Just move your legs.

00:13:50.220 --> 00:13:51.800
What are you doing, you idiot?!

00:13:51.800 --> 00:13:53.480
Chiaki can't swim!

00:13:53.480 --> 00:13:54.930
What if she'd drowned?!

00:13:56.670 --> 00:13:59.940
I just wanted to show her how terrifying the ocean can be!

00:14:00.290 --> 00:14:02.280
You're the real terror here!

00:14:02.280 --> 00:14:05.570
You're supposed to be her big sister! Start thinking before you act!

00:14:05.980 --> 00:14:07.360
Sorry.

00:14:14.180 --> 00:14:15.410
Take this!

00:14:17.200 --> 00:14:19.180
That sea cucumber is my apology!

00:14:22.380 --> 00:14:23.730
Are you okay?

00:14:23.730 --> 00:14:25.800
What about you?

00:14:25.800 --> 00:14:29.130
Yeah. Because you never let me go.

00:14:33.470 --> 00:14:35.060
Thank you, Mako-chan.

00:14:35.620 --> 00:14:38.770
I hope we'll be friends forever.

00:14:38.770 --> 00:14:39.630
Sure.

00:14:51.000 --> 00:14:53.870
Thanks for earlier, Kana.

00:14:53.870 --> 00:14:57.080
Oh, you like sea cucumbers? I've got more.

00:14:57.080 --> 00:14:58.370
No!

00:14:59.020 --> 00:15:01.750
I became closer to Chiaki thanks to you.

00:15:02.180 --> 00:15:03.500
Oh. Okay.

00:15:03.910 --> 00:15:06.550
Thank you so much for asking me to come.

00:15:06.550 --> 00:15:08.630
I'm glad I came to the beach today.

00:15:10.070 --> 00:15:12.660
Don't let your guard down 'til the end.

00:15:12.660 --> 00:15:14.390
This beach visit isn't over yet.

00:15:14.760 --> 00:15:16.890
Our shift's almost over.

00:15:16.890 --> 00:15:19.580
Yeah. Let's go have fun with
.Haruka and the others.

00:15:27.650 --> 00:15:29.490
Let's eat!

00:15:33.490 --> 00:15:38.870
Yeah! This rubbery texture and strong
.burnt scent are what yakisoba's all about!

00:15:40.670 --> 00:15:45.920
There's European and Indian style
.curry, but this is the instant style.

00:15:48.420 --> 00:15:51.720
Doesn't it feel like extra value when your ramen noodles come all soft?

00:15:52.160 --> 00:15:54.390
So the food sucks?

00:15:54.760 --> 00:15:57.810
Geez! We were all trying not to say it!

00:15:59.220 --> 00:16:02.150
You've ruined our trip!

00:16:02.150 --> 00:16:04.480
I've lost my appetite.

00:16:19.830 --> 00:16:22.290
Chiaki looks really depressed now.

00:16:22.290 --> 00:16:24.470
Yeah. I feel sorry for her.

00:16:24.470 --> 00:16:25.750
Leave her be.

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:31.630
But I can't enjoy myself when
.someone else is down in the dumps.

00:16:31.630 --> 00:16:35.460
I'll stay with Chiaki.
You girls go have fun.

00:16:35.460 --> 00:16:36.890
No!

00:16:36.890 --> 00:16:39.510
You're always doting on her like that!

00:16:39.510 --> 00:16:41.890
That's why she acts depressed
every time she wants attention!

00:16:43.100 --> 00:16:45.560
You've spoiled Chiaki!

00:16:54.380 --> 00:16:57.000
That was too harsh, Kana-chan.

00:16:57.000 --> 00:16:58.990
I had to speak out about this.

00:16:58.990 --> 00:17:03.500
Didn't Chiaki get depressed because Kana was too harsh on her?

00:17:03.910 --> 00:17:05.620
It's not my fault!

00:17:05.620 --> 00:17:08.980
I'm not gonna talk to people
who are so uncooperative!

00:17:17.250 --> 00:17:19.260
I'm hungry.

00:17:24.600 --> 00:17:25.770
Chiaki, stop!

00:17:25.770 --> 00:17:30.260
We all promised we'd split
the watermelon together!

00:17:30.260 --> 00:17:32.120
But.. but...

00:17:33.570 --> 00:17:39.660
It was my fault nobody ate much earlier, so I thought you'd all be hungry.

00:17:39.660 --> 00:17:44.620
I was going to make amends by
.splitting the watermelon really well.

00:17:44.620 --> 00:17:46.160
Chiaki...

00:17:46.580 --> 00:17:48.420
Don't worry, Chiaki.

00:17:48.420 --> 00:17:50.170
No one's mad at you about that.

00:17:50.170 --> 00:17:51.340
Stop!

00:17:51.340 --> 00:17:53.550
Whose head do you think you're patting?!

00:17:53.910 --> 00:17:56.800
All right! Let's split the watermelon!

00:17:56.800 --> 00:17:58.670
Yeah!

00:17:59.690 --> 00:18:01.530
Right! To your right!

00:18:01.530 --> 00:18:03.310
A little left. Little left.

00:18:03.310 --> 00:18:04.730
Yeah, like that. Right in front of you.

00:18:04.730 --> 00:18:05.720
Now!

00:18:14.130 --> 00:18:15.610
Wow, look at this!

00:18:16.020 --> 00:18:18.700
It's so sweet and juicy!

00:18:19.490 --> 00:18:22.330
This sandy part is especially good.

00:18:22.330 --> 00:18:24.290
No, that's bad.

00:18:24.970 --> 00:18:27.500
I thought you two weren't talking.

00:18:32.670 --> 00:18:34.710
Take a look at my tan.

00:18:34.710 --> 00:18:37.650
Oh, that's a nice tan line. You can really see the swim top.

00:18:38.180 --> 00:18:41.050
When I went to the beach with you...

00:18:42.450 --> 00:18:45.680
My summer ended on that day.

00:18:46.160 --> 00:18:48.310
I couldn't go to the pool
with Shuuichi and the guys,

00:18:48.310 --> 00:18:51.600
and I couldn't walk around
topless after baths.

00:18:51.600 --> 00:18:53.820
That's tough.

00:18:53.820 --> 00:18:56.840
So you can't show your
.skin in public for a while.

00:18:56.840 --> 00:18:57.820
That's right.

00:18:57.820 --> 00:19:00.020
You're like a girl embarrassed to show her body!

00:19:00.020 --> 00:19:01.820
I'm like a <i>man</i> embarrassed to show his <i>tan</i>!

00:19:03.420 --> 00:19:05.740
Hey, what's with the band-aid?

00:19:05.740 --> 00:19:07.480
Oh, this?

00:19:07.480 --> 00:19:09.750
Remember when we went
..to school few days ago...

00:19:10.870 --> 00:19:12.170
Ow...

00:19:12.170 --> 00:19:13.340
Are you all right?

00:19:13.340 --> 00:19:16.020
You should go to the nurse's office.

00:19:16.020 --> 00:19:18.010
Let me see.

00:19:19.510 --> 00:19:20.260
Here you go.

00:19:20.760 --> 00:19:22.090
All better now.

00:19:22.090 --> 00:19:23.510
Th-Thanks.

00:19:24.840 --> 00:19:28.460
Chiaki, I'll cherish this band-aid
for the rest of my life!

00:19:28.460 --> 00:19:29.770
I'll never take it off as long as I live.

00:19:29.770 --> 00:19:31.830
Take it off when it gets better.

00:19:33.420 --> 00:19:34.520
Huh?

00:19:35.130 --> 00:19:39.440
That means you got it as Makoto.

00:19:39.440 --> 00:19:39.990
Yeah.

00:19:39.990 --> 00:19:44.410
In other words, if Chiaki sees you wearing that same band-aid as Mako-chan,

00:19:44.410 --> 00:19:46.910
she might figure out who you really are.

00:19:48.930 --> 00:19:50.830
Wh-What should I do?!

00:19:50.830 --> 00:19:53.380
Why don't you take it off for now?

00:19:53.380 --> 00:19:56.880
No! I decided I'd never take it off!

00:19:56.880 --> 00:19:59.690
But Chiaki will find out.

00:19:59.690 --> 00:20:01.840
What about me?

00:20:05.160 --> 00:20:06.640
N-Nothing.

00:20:07.020 --> 00:20:08.380
Whatever.

00:20:09.090 --> 00:20:11.540
Mako-chan, let's play Othello.

00:20:12.270 --> 00:20:13.400
No, thanks.

00:20:13.400 --> 00:20:16.360
If we play that, she'll be able to see the back of my right hand!

00:20:16.760 --> 00:20:18.150
Oh, okay.

00:20:18.650 --> 00:20:19.740
Then...

00:20:20.270 --> 00:20:22.710
Mako-chan, want some cookies?

00:20:22.710 --> 00:20:24.660
Uh... That's okay. I'll pass.

00:20:24.660 --> 00:20:27.410
I'd need to use my hand to take one...

00:20:29.510 --> 00:20:30.330
Mako-chan—

00:20:30.330 --> 00:20:31.620
No thanks!

00:20:31.620 --> 00:20:33.080
The band-aid...

00:20:36.920 --> 00:20:38.760
What's wrong, Chiaki?

00:20:39.870 --> 00:20:43.680
All I got from Mako-chan
.was that pose of denial.

00:20:45.180 --> 00:20:48.710
We got along so well when
..we went to the beach...

00:20:48.710 --> 00:20:51.180
but now she hates me.

00:20:51.180 --> 00:20:52.930
That's not true!

00:20:52.930 --> 00:20:55.940
Mako-chan loves you.

00:20:55.940 --> 00:20:57.950
But that pose...

00:20:57.950 --> 00:21:01.980
I'm sure she was just throwing her hands up in celebration!

00:21:01.980 --> 00:21:03.950
Let's reaffirm your friendship.

00:21:03.950 --> 00:21:05.160
It'll be all right.

00:21:05.160 --> 00:21:07.220
Okay, I got it.

00:21:07.220 --> 00:21:08.870
Thanks, Uchida.

00:21:10.800 --> 00:21:12.670
Hey, Makoto-kun.

00:21:13.530 --> 00:21:15.910
Don't hide the back of your hand like this.

00:21:15.910 --> 00:21:16.800
Do it like this!

00:21:16.800 --> 00:21:17.790
Got it?

00:21:18.260 --> 00:21:19.750
Like this?

00:21:19.750 --> 00:21:21.050
Mako-chan...

00:21:22.180 --> 00:21:25.550
Are we... friends?

00:21:29.430 --> 00:21:30.890
Mako-chan!

00:21:30.890 --> 00:21:32.520
I'm so glad!

00:21:34.580 --> 00:21:36.010
Not the hands....

00:21:36.010 --> 00:21:36.900
Not the hands.

00:21:42.360 --> 00:21:46.070
On behalf of Chiaki, I'd like to say:

00:21:46.650 --> 00:21:48.830
Mako-chan, you moron!

00:23:20.870 --> 00:23:21.500
Haruka-chan.

00:23:21.500 --> 00:23:24.080
Please act cute for the preview.

00:23:24.080 --> 00:23:26.120
A-Act cute?

00:23:26.630 --> 00:23:30.180
Next time: "Coming for a Late Summer Visit."

00:23:30.180 --> 00:23:32.550
That was Haruka-chan, the cutie.

00:23:32.550 --> 00:23:34.450
I'm never doing that again.
